{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01A6VmE4GqNUvcNBZQ3b4BhU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## rnd-v11.1 â€” \"Handoff Always Primes\" â€” Build Session Summary\n\n**Goal:** Close the v11 keystone's last gap â€” a research session whose work existed only as a terminal conversation (no written file) used to refuse the advance or open the next stage with a misleading prompt, losing the actual research.\n\n**Grounded claims (sourced from the Execution Log):**\n\n- **Built in 3 waves, all GREEN, on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v11.1`** off master `b6719bd` (v11 merged); baseline at branch cut was GREEN 1232, final gate **GREEN 1266 passed, 1 skipped**.\n\n- **Wave 1 (keystone, backend) â€” GREEN after 3 iterations.** `prepare_stage_handoff` gained a synchronous transcript snapshot: when the initial persist produces no doc, it reads the source PTY buffer (`read_since(sid,0)`), cleans it, writes `<source_worktree>/<lane>/<sid[:12]>-transcript.md`, re-persists it (session-tagged), and builds a real doc-referencing prompt naming it â€” best-effort, never-raises, firing only when no doc-classified file was produced. `handoff.build_next_stage_prompt`'s no-docs fallback was rewritten honest + actionable (\"create the materials,\" no false \"report in worktree\" claim).\n\n- **Wave 1 review caught a real stub-blind-spot (the v11 lesson recurring).** A reviewer flagged the first cleaner as STUB-adequate but REAL-ConPTY-inadequate (its `\\r`-replace expanded spinner redraws, byte-exact seed-strip failed on wrapped output, the background-refine was dead in prod, and a tail-only cap dropped early framing) â†’ Judge NO-GO. Fix: rewrote `_clean_transcript_text` into a 6-stage real-ConPTY pipeline, and `anchor_gui.main()` now exports `ANCHOR_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY=1` so the refine actually runs in production.\n\n- **Wave 1 fix exposed a prod double-summary regression** (gate-caught): making the env gate live revealed that killing a planning session fired BOTH the summary-on-finish hook and the keystone background summary. Fixed by having `_trigger_background_source_summary` skip a TERMINAL source (DONE/FAILED) while still firing for a LIVE source.\n\n- **Wave 2 (grass, UI) â€” GREEN, John signed off 2026-06-20.** Removed the `no-research-material` hard-refusal so `advance_grass_research_to_plan` always falls through to the v10 contained-grass mint/focus/link machinery with the transcript-backed (or honest-minimal) prompt; kept the `no-research-session` negative.\n\n- **Wave 2 review caught a silent broken handoff** (the develop-plan-first + conversation-only ordering case): the transcript was committed to main HEAD and named, but the pre-existing plan worktree was cut before the commit â†’ file absent from its checkout. Fixed by `_materialize_handoff_into_plan_worktree`, which copies the persisted transcript into the plan worktree and writes HANDOFF.md + NEXT-PROMPT.md there (matching the non-grass path), wired into both fresh-mint and focused-existing branches.\n\n- **Wave 3 (healthcheck + docs) â€” GREEN, PROJECT DONE.** `anchor_healthcheck.check_rnd_v11_1_surface` (registered in `main()`) walks the real conversation-only flow fully stubbed (seeds the stub PTY buffer with transcript content â€” no file/`record_effort`/kill â€” and asserts the transcript is snapshotted/persisted/committed/named, plus the grass path materializes it on disk in the plan worktree); `ANCHOR_PROACTIVE_SUMMARY` is saved/restored in an unconditional finally. CLAUDE.md gained the v11.1 section.\n\n- **Verification discipline (the v11.1 lesson):** conversation-only tests must seed the stub PTY read buffer (not write a file) â€” proven non-vacuous by tests that FAIL pre-fix (`test_handoff_transcript_v11_1.py`, `test_advance_research_to_plan_conversation_v11_1.py`, `test_clean_transcript_v11_1.py`, `test_grass_advance_develop_plan_first_materializes_transcript`).\n\n**Status:** All 3 waves GREEN; branch ready for merge + deploy â€” **no merge / no `nssm restart` until John signs off the whole branch.**"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3701,"cache_read_input_tokens":96093,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3701},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96e524cd-01e1-4711-9f3d-078d4c189abd","uuid":"0031be84-5243-4966-8b13-3c8aea3e829d","request_id":"req_011CcJo4MQoM9tYpPa4rjnkw"}
